package skill

const AnalysisRuntimeComparisonTeaching = "For independent baseline/current captures, use comparison={baseline:{path,source_quote},current:{path,source_quote}}. Each local verbatim quote contains only its own original path; paths are not inferred from names or array order. Add time_start/time_end together only on a side with a literal requested interval and include that interval in its quote; never invent endpoints or borrow the other side's window. Use requested_scope=explicit_time_window if any side has endpoints, otherwise unspecified; full_artifact additionally needs a verbatim whole-capture source_quote. Do not combine comparison with pooled time_windows/scalar endpoints. This requests independent acquisition, not matching devices, clocks, workloads, differences or causality. Ordinary single-capture time_windows remain available."
